":"/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite/","slug":"marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite","title":"Marvelous Magical Jackobious Son (A Sweaterless Suite)","artist":{"slug":"afta-1-and-cazeaux-oslo","title":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo"},"artwork":"images/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Bbs-gpMjoVY","position":82,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo - Marvelous Magical Jackobious Son (A Sweaterless Suite)","track":{"id":"74APnTt-1h4","path":"/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite/","slug":"marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite","title":"Marvelous Magical Jackobious Son (A Sweaterless Suite)","artist":{"slug":"afta-1-and-cazeaux-oslo","title":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo"},"artwork":"images/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"k3Dc-9G6lBw","position":90,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Afta-1 & Cazeaux Oslo - M.M.J.S. (A Sweaterless Suite)","track":{"id":"G9ugVD_78Oc","path":"/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/m-m-j-s-a-sweaterless-suite/","slug":"mmjs-a-sweaterless-suite","title":"M.M.J.S. (A Sweaterless Suite)","artist":{"slug":"afta-1-and-cazeaux-oslo","title":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo"},"artwork":"images/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/m-m-j-s-a-sweaterless-suite.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Rqym6n1sXI0","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo - Marvelous Magical Jackobious Son (A Sweaterless Suite)","track":{"id":"74APnTt-1h4","path":"/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite/","slug":"marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite","title":"Marvelous Magical Jackobious Son (A Sweaterless Suite)","artist":{"slug":"afta-1-and-cazeaux-oslo","title":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo"},"artwork":"images/artists/afta-1-cazeaux-oslo/tracks/marvelous-magical-jackobious-son-a-sweaterless-suite.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kl47T3kNDKo","slug":"177","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-177-ft-dpat-siveys-live-set"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #177 Ft. (Dpat + Sivey's Live Set)","artwork":"/images/episodes/177.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"X-nU0bQCQGI","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"AFTA-1 & Cazeaux Oslo - M.M.J.S. (A Sweaterless Suite)","track":{"id":"G9ugVD_78Oc","path":"/artists/afta-1-cazeaux